note scribed gate hell gateway second~
  ....it struck us odd that the second gate lacked a keyhole until we realized
that it was just a piece of humor from Jaqon, the Satyr. After all, it
was that outcast which appeared to the first of us in the desert so many
eons ago and showed us the location of the Gateways. In time, we shall learn
how to reverse their flow, and open up the minions of Hell onto the world!
Only then may we become one of them.
